{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44813","headline":"春游司直城西鸬鹚谿别业 · 清江","name":"春游司直城西鸬鹚谿别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别墅军城下，闲諠未可齐。\n春深花蝶梦，晓隔柳烟鞞。\n韶景浮寒水，疎杨映绿堤。\n沿洄看竹色，来往听莺啼。\n久慢持生术，多亲种药畦。\n家贫知素行，心苦见清溪。\n越客初投分，南枝得寄栖。\n禅机空寂寞，雅趣赖招携。\n本寺重江外，游方二室西。\n裴回恋知己，日夕草萋萋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清江","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}